{"id": "spring-test/src/main/java/org/springframework/mock/jndi/SimpleNamingContextBuilder.java::139::0", "file": "spring-test/src/main/java/org/springframework/mock/jndi/SimpleNamingContextBuilder.java", "module": "spring-test", "block_start": 139, "start": 140, "end": 143, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Register the context builder by registering it with the JNDI NamingManager.", "Note that once this has been done, {@code new InitialContext()} will always", "return a context from this factory. Use the {@code emptyActivatedContextBuilder()}", "static method to get an empty context (for example, in test methods)."]}
