{"id": "spring-test/src/main/java/org/springframework/mock/jndi/package-info.java::1::2", "file": "spring-test/src/main/java/org/springframework/mock/jndi/package-info.java", "module": "spring-test", "block_start": 1, "start": 8, "end": 11, "indent": "", "lines": ["<p>Useful for setting up a simple JNDI environment for test suites", "or stand-alone applications. If, for example, JDBC DataSources get bound to the", "same JNDI names as within a Java EE container, both application code and", "configuration can be reused without changes."]}
